WEBVTT

00:05:00.928 --> 00:05:04.924
that will cut down almost entirely
the cost of higher education.

00:05:05.927 --> 00:05:07.412
And that's how we did it.

00:05:07.869 --> 00:05:10.405
First, bricks and mortar cost money.

00:05:11.324 --> 00:05:16.446
Universities have expenses
that virtual universities don't.

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:19.616
We don't need to pass these expenses
on to our students.

00:05:20.124 --> 00:05:21.504
They don't exist.

00:05:21.528 --> 00:05:24.647
We also don't need
to worry about capacity.

00:05:24.671 --> 00:05:28.295
There are no limits of seats
in virtual university.

00:05:28.867 --> 00:05:32.657
Actually, nobody needs to stand
at the back of the lecture hall.